1
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:09,000
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,518
You're on the move!

3
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:10,971
Embarrassing you in front of millions
of people is more fun than I imagined.

4
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:13,520
Now, let the humiliation continue.

5
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,600
I activate the power of Nibelung's ring.

6
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:20,760
This forces you to draw two cards,
and if there are any monsters,

7
00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:22,577
they're immediately destroyed.

8
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:24,366
And you think that scares me?

9
00:01:24,540 --> 00:01:25,760
Well, think again.

10
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:27,777
Now let's get this over with.

11
00:01:27,860 --> 00:01:30,240
It looks like you're out of luck.

12
00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:31,840
No monsters here.

13
00:01:32,100 --> 00:01:34,460
So, I'll place this face down.

14
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:38,937
Well, since there's nothing else you
can do, I assume that ends your turn.

15
00:01:39,020 --> 00:01:42,820
After all, my ring has rendered
your dragon cannon useless.

16
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:44,730
Uh-oh.

17
00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:46,457
This doesn't look good, guys.

18
00:01:46,540 --> 00:01:48,480
You know what's next, right?

19
00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:53,880
Valkyrie Zwei, use your fortune chariot
and attack his life points directly.

20
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:59,580
I activate my trap card!

21
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,240
Attack Guidance Armor!

22
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:05,900
Now your attack gets redirected
to your other monster!

23
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:12,240
I have a little trap card of
my own, so my Valkyrie is safe!

24
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:16,660
How, you ask?

25
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:18,977
Well, that's the beauty
of Wotan's judgment!

26
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:24,180
By switching one magic card from my
hand with the top card off my deck,

27
00:02:24,420 --> 00:02:27,655
I am able to instantly end
the battle phase of my turn.

28
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:31,040
Now, let's see if fate
was good to me, shall we?

29
00:02:33,220 --> 00:02:35,060
Lovely, just lovely.

30
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:38,927
Thanks to you, I've assembled
three of my most powerful cards.

31
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:42,080
Now, help me welcome...

32
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:52,340
Those dames are nothing but bad news.

33
00:02:52,660 --> 00:02:54,520
Yeah, he played them last time.

34
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:57,480
They nearly destroyed your deck. Look,

35
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:01,077
that lame strategy may have worked
against a dork like Wheeler,

36
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:02,925
but I'm in a different league.

37
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,360
Oh, is that so?

38
00:03:04,580 --> 00:03:07,037
Why don't we let my goddesses
be the judge of that

39
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:10,137
By having a look at the top
three cards of your deck.

40
00:03:10,220 --> 00:03:12,867
Now, Goddess Skulld,
Protector of the Future,

41
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:15,940
