42
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,350
Impossible!

43
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,520
Three Blue-Eyes White Dragons?

44
00:03:25,620 --> 00:03:29,973
By the expression on your face, I'm
guessing my destiny looks pretty good.

45
00:03:30,180 --> 00:03:33,777
Please, you verdume the
moment you decided to duel me.

46
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:37,680
Now I call upon my goddess
Mordanda, protector of the present.

47
00:03:38,620 --> 00:03:40,820
Time for me to guess your top card.

48
00:03:41,180 --> 00:03:42,680
I'll say it's a monster.

49
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:46,720
Gee, how'd you ever guess?

50
00:03:47,020 --> 00:03:49,549
Just place it on the
field in defense mode.

51
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:50,820
Sure, whatever.

52
00:03:53,420 --> 00:03:58,460
Now I'll remove that very card from the
game by correctly predicting its identity.

53
00:03:58,980 --> 00:04:02,140
Goddess Earl, protector
of the past, guide me.

54
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:06,842
I predict the card you just played
is your blue-eyes white dragon!

55
00:04:15,780 --> 00:04:16,700
It's gone!

56
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:17,960
This is bad!

57
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:20,920
Why the long face? Oh, right.

58
00:04:21,140 --> 00:04:23,140
I destroyed your favorite monster.

59
00:04:23,540 --> 00:04:26,340
But that's just the beginning, Herr Kaiba.

60
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:31,297
You and your company have been a
thorn in my side since the day we met,

61
00:04:31,380 --> 00:04:34,420
So it's time to remove
you once and for all.

62
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:38,380
I'll take it from here.

63
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:40,620
Hold on.

64
00:04:40,780 --> 00:04:42,180
How soon we forget.

65
00:04:42,580 --> 00:04:44,560
Your dragon is wearing my ring.

66
00:04:44,780 --> 00:04:48,240
So the card you just drew goes
straight to the graveyard.

67
00:04:49,780 --> 00:04:54,140
And since you can't attack, I can
only assume you're ending your turn.

68
00:04:54,580 --> 00:04:55,960
Will you assume wrong?

69
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:59,300
I play Monster Reborn. You what?

70
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,040
Now, show yourself.

71
00:05:01,380 --> 00:05:03,080
Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

72
00:05:08,020 --> 00:05:09,757
That's what I'm talking about!

73
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:11,277
In your face, Sieg Freak!

74
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:14,280
Nobody comes between me and my Blue-Eyes!

75
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:17,460
And anyone foolish enough
to try pays the price!

76
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,800
What happened?

77
00:05:25,100 --> 00:05:26,600
I gave up my chariot!

78
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:29,480
So my Valkyrie's vile remains unharmed!

79
00:05:30,460 --> 00:05:32,380
But your life points don't.

80
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:34,680
It looks like the same old story.

81
00:05:35,020 --> 00:05:38,380
I rise to the top and you
get lost in my shadow.

82
00:05:39,380 --> 00:05:40,260
We'll see.

83
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:43,920
Now, I invoke the power of my goddesses.

84
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:46,660
Show me his top three cards.

85
00:05:49,740 --> 00:05:52,520
Place the third card on
the top of your deck.

86
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:57,440
Now all I have to do is call its
name and it's removed from plague.

87
00:05:58,140 --> 00:06:00,120
Luster Dragon number two!

88
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:10,360
Next, I activate a magic card
known as Griffon's Feather Duster.

89
00:06:11,940 --> 00:06:16,560
First, it takes away every magic and
trap card on my side of the field.

90
00:06:17,020 --> 00:06:21,160
But then it leaves me with 500
extra life points for each one.

91
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:26,357
He just got back everything
Blue Eyes took away!

92
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:32,140
And then finally, I'll sacrifice my
Valkyrie Öster and my Valkyrie Zweig.

93
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:39,460
That lets me summon my Valkyrie
Brunhilde in defense mode.

94
00:06:47,100 --> 00:06:50,460
And by the way, sorry
to ruin the surprise,

95
00:06:50,740 --> 00:06:55,437
but the card you're about to draw is a
monster and unfortunately it won't last long.

96
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:57,460
Do I care? No.

97
00:06:57,860 --> 00:06:59,100
Well, you should.

98
00:06:59,580 --> 00:07:01,840
I activate Nibelung's ring.

99
00:07:02,380 --> 00:07:04,460
Your monster is no more!

100
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:08,260
I don't need that card anyway.

101
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:12,540
Not when I have blue eyes. Attack now!

102
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,557
No way!

103
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:29,560
As you can see, Brunhilde escaped without
a scratch, thanks to her special ability.

104
00:07:29,860 --> 00:07:32,742
But all I had to do was
lower her defense points.

105
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:35,257
I place this face down.

106
00:07:35,340 --> 00:07:36,960
That ends my turn.

107
00:07:37,340 --> 00:07:39,020
Another move wasted.

108
00:07:39,420 --> 00:07:42,957
Eventually, your girlfriend's gonna
run out of points, and when she does,

109
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,452
my dragon'll be waiting.

110
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,661
But by that point, I'll have won.

111
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:51,557
And speaking of winning, watch
as I end this duel right now!

112
00:07:51,640 --> 00:07:54,260
Now, I switch Brunhilde to attack mode.

113
00:07:54,580 --> 00:07:59,160
Now, for every dragon on the field,
her strength increases by 300.

114
00:08:01,340 --> 00:08:05,780
Next, I'll play this, the magic
card, Enchanted Sword, Nothan.

115
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:15,120
What do you think of my new toy?

116
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:17,795
On second, sir, don't answer that yet.

117
00:08:17,960 --> 00:08:19,901
Wait till you see what it can do.

118
00:08:24,980 --> 00:08:28,320
Oh, Kaiba's blue eyes
is gone. Yeah, but how?

119
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:32,740
Not only does my enchanted sword
remove all dragons from the game,

120
00:08:32,860 --> 00:08:34,680
it gives my maiden a boost.

121
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:39,240
Tell me, Herr Kaiba, what's it
like being a washed-up has-been?

122
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:41,280
Why don't you tell me?

123
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,680
Enough small talk.

124
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:46,660
I activate the magic card Pegasus Ving.

125
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:51,780
You're no match for me,
which you never were!

126
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:56,480
Now all I have to do is cut my
Valkyrie's strength in half! After that,

127
00:08:56,640 --> 00:09:01,464
I'm afforded the distinct honor of being
able to attack your life points directly!

128
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:03,680
Go ahead!

129
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,540
That card will protect me!

130
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:10,260
I already know the identity of
your face-down card, Herr Kaiba,

131
00:09:10,460 --> 00:09:13,257
